    "title": "TNA Bound For Glory 2026 Ticket Update - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James Hetfield ,\n21 hours ago TNA Wrestling is scheduled to hold its 2026 Bound For Glory pay-per-view (PPV) event on Sunday, October 11, at the Yuengling Center in Tampa, Florida. According to WrestleTix, a total of 734 tickets have been sold, reflecting an increase of 12 tickets since the last update four days ago. The venue’s wrestling setup can accommodate approximately 9,440 seats, with 2,444 seats currently available for sale. The report indicates that 1,710 tickets are available in the current configuration, and the cheapest standard-admission ticket is priced at $59.35. Read full article",
